(6457909, 958739, 19825, '<td valign="top">It is an interesting shot and the boat has a lot of character. For whatever it is worth, you might have been able to improve things more in processing -- increase saturation a touch, relieve the slightly blown out look in the stern, increase the contrast and blues of the water.</td>', 'It is an interesting shot and the boat has a lot of character. For whatever it is worth, you might have been able to improve things more in processing -- increase saturation a touch, relieve the slightly blown out look in the stern, increase the contrast and blues of the water.', '2011-07-01 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
