(6458161, 959385, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really nice! There''s a huge gannet colony in Newfoundland too. I love going there to take pictures but don''t go often, it''s a long drive.</td>', 'Really nice! There''s a huge gannet colony in Newfoundland too. I love going there to take pictures but don''t go often, it''s a long drive.', '2011-07-01 17:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
