(6458165, 959741, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice!</td>', 'Wow, nice!', '2011-07-01 17:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458166, 959671, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this a hawkmoth/hummingbird moth? Cool.</td>', 'Is this a hawkmoth/hummingbird moth? Cool.', '2011-07-01 17:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458167, 959196, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool!!!</td>', 'Cool!!!', '2011-07-01 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458168, 958579, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ha, love his expression! Cool subject, photo seems a bit dark.</td>', 'Ha, love his expression! Cool subject, photo seems a bit dark.', '2011-07-01 17:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458169, 959794, 43774, '<td valign="top">Awww, how very sweet!</td>', 'Awww, how very sweet!', '2011-07-01 17:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458170, 959692, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colour/detail.</td>', 'Very nice composition and colour/detail.', '2011-07-01 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458171, 959843, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail I just wish he was looking at the camera! (picky aren''t I)</td>', 'Wonderful detail I just wish he was looking at the camera! (picky aren''t I)', '2011-07-01 17:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458263, 958736, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good composition, soft focus, bokeh excellent, good title. The lone derelict telephone pole adds weight to a Global Impact/Warming storyline. 50/50 that NG would publish it on it''s own merit however, sorry!</td>', 'Good composition, soft focus, bokeh excellent, good title. The lone derelict telephone pole adds weight to a Global Impact/Warming storyline. 50/50 that NG would publish it on it''s own merit however, sorry!', '2011-07-01 20:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458265, 959645, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great composition, colour, focus not crisp, bokeh excellent, good title. Wildlife story. However 50/50 that NG would publish this on the lack of focus, sorry!</td>', 'Great composition, colour, focus not crisp, bokeh excellent, good title. Wildlife story. However 50/50 that NG would publish this on the lack of focus, sorry!', '2011-07-01 20:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458268, 959551, 108580, '<td valign="top">NG have a cover of Asian temples in the morning mist with which this bears some slight similarity to, minus the temples and the man made smoke. It shows how man has impact on the Earth. If displayed as a series of images in a story based on farming practices it''s likely that this would appear in NG.</td>', 'NG have a cover of Asian temples in the morning mist with which this bears some slight similarity to, minus the temples and the man made smoke. It shows how man has impact on the Earth. If displayed as a series of images in a story based on farming practices it''s likely that this would appear in NG.', '2011-07-01 20:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458274, 959247, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good timing to get the mother engaging you, and wary of your human presence. NG photos I believe have some "engaging" quality, a style, a moment. Selection criterion for publication is very high and they must tell a story. The foal''s left ear is also directed toward you, wary. The overall green tinge is a but much, I can''t say if sat was pushed or not but it does feel that way. It could be published in NG.</td>', 'Good timing to get the mother engaging you, and wary of your human presence. NG photos I believe have some "engaging" quality, a style, a moment. Selection criterion for publication is very high and they must tell a story. The foal''s left ear is also directed toward you, wary. The overall green tinge is a but much, I can''t say if sat was pushed or not but it does feel that way. It could be published in NG.', '2011-07-01 20:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458275, 959662, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like the title and with the benefit of hindsight of if having read the "article" tying in with the shot, could work as an NG image. It seems a bit colourless though and the 4 backs to the camera are not engaging enough. It is certainly a departure from wildlife, science and nature. Photojournalism. Candid. Human interest story? I''m not swayed it would be published.</td>', 'I like the title and with the benefit of hindsight of if having read the "article" tying in with the shot, could work as an NG image. It seems a bit colourless though and the 4 backs to the camera are not engaging enough. It is certainly a departure from wildlife, science and nature. Photojournalism. Candid. Human interest story? I''m not swayed it would be published.', '2011-07-01 20:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458284, 958394, 108580, '<td valign="top">Superb shot. The sudden activity of the foal and perhaps also the parent behind it has startled the birds. You have captured this moment well. The triangle formed between all three bison, plus the motion of the birds give life to a still image. I think it would be published in NG.</td>', 'Superb shot. The sudden activity of the foal and perhaps also the parent behind it has startled the birds. You have captured this moment well. The triangle formed between all three bison, plus the motion of the birds give life to a still image. I think it would be published in NG.', '2011-07-01 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458300, 959244, 5034, '<td valign="top">I love the detail on the eye on this one, you got the focal point exactly right, also I love the lighting, really makes the shot talk.  10.</td>', 'I love the detail on the eye on this one, you got the focal point exactly right, also I love the lighting, really makes the shot talk.  10.', '2011-07-01 21:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458325, 959052, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Excellent in all respects.</td>', 'Great capture.  Excellent in all respects.', '2011-07-01 21:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458326, 959705, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of scale here.  Really got me to think about the subject with this image!</td>', 'Love the sense of scale here.  Really got me to think about the subject with this image!', '2011-07-01 21:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458329, 958394, 65234, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal capture!!  If it weren''t for the birds it would look like a museum diorama.</td>', 'Phenomenal capture!!  If it weren''t for the birds it would look like a museum diorama.', '2011-07-01 21:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458331, 959559, 65234, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m being influenced by the yellow border (I''m amused to have seen a few in this challenge), but I can absolutely see this as a picture in NG.  There''s a story here ... probably quite a few of them.</td>', 'Maybe I''m being influenced by the yellow border (I''m amused to have seen a few in this challenge), but I can absolutely see this as a picture in NG.  There''s a story here ... probably quite a few of them.', '2011-07-01 21:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458335, 959052, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful moment to capture!  Not the perfect angle, maybe, but I can''t imagine you get too many chances at a scene like this.  I''m really quite intrigued by this.</td>', 'What a wonderful moment to capture!  Not the perfect angle, maybe, but I can''t imagine you get too many chances at a scene like this.  I''m really quite intrigued by this.', '2011-07-01 22:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458336, 959422, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  Makes me wonder a bit about the crowding, and how long people ride on the outside of the train!</td>', 'Very interesting image.  Makes me wonder a bit about the crowding, and how long people ride on the outside of the train!', '2011-07-01 22:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458337, 958628, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and detail.</td>', 'Very nice light and detail.', '2011-07-01 22:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458338, 959429, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and fascinating.</td>', 'Beautiful and fascinating.', '2011-07-01 22:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458339, 959409, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fun angle :-)  Plenty of detail and context; I can see this accompanying a magazine article.</td>', 'Fun angle :-)  Plenty of detail and context; I can see this accompanying a magazine article.', '2011-07-01 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458341, 959742, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful pattern; well presented.  DOF is perfect.  One of nature''s more interesting pieces of art.</td>', 'Really beautiful pattern; well presented.  DOF is perfect.  One of nature''s more interesting pieces of art.', '2011-07-01 22:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458343, 959562, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Heck of a wingspan on that owl.</td>', 'Great capture!  Heck of a wingspan on that owl.', '2011-07-01 22:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458345, 959827, 65234, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail.  Still not cute ;-)</td>', 'Incredible detail.  Still not cute ;-)', '2011-07-01 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458348, 959618, 65234, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even realize there were two spiders the first time I looked at this.  That poor bee was doomed.  Such drama under a little flower!</td>', 'I didn''t even realize there were two spiders the first time I looked at this.  That poor bee was doomed.  Such drama under a little flower!', '2011-07-01 22:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458351, 959495, 65234, '<td valign="top">Crows are gutsy birds!  Great moment to capture.  I''d like to see the crow''s eye brought out a bit (if that''s possible) just to add his facial expression to the story.</td>', 'Crows are gutsy birds!  Great moment to capture.  I''d like to see the crow''s eye brought out a bit (if that''s possible) just to add his facial expression to the story.', '2011-07-01 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458358, 959663, 65234, '<td valign="top">First of all this is gorgeous.  LOVE the color, the clarity and sheen on the Damsel''s head, the way the grass emerges from the creamy bokeh.  Beautifully composed.  Now comes the "but."  IMO, a shot of a bug in NG is going to need to have the entire bug in focus.  So I can''t give this a perfect score ... but I like it too much not to give it a good one.</td>', 'First of all this is gorgeous.  LOVE the color, the clarity and sheen on the Damsel''s head, the way the grass emerges from the creamy bokeh.  Beautifully composed.  Now comes the "but."  IMO, a shot of a bug in NG is going to need to have the entire bug in focus.  So I can''t give this a perfect score ... but I like it too much not to give it a good one.', '2011-07-01 22:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458359, 959843, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s a Mockingbird.  I wouldn''t get too close watching one of those assertive little monsters!  Nice detail on him.  For this challenge, a little more environmental context wouldn''t be a bad thing.</td>', 'It''s a Mockingbird.  I wouldn''t get too close watching one of those assertive little monsters!  Nice detail on him.  For this challenge, a little more environmental context wouldn''t be a bad thing.', '2011-07-01 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458360, 959396, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light on him.  Looks a bit OOF, like there was a bit of camera shake.</td>', 'Nice light on him.  Looks a bit OOF, like there was a bit of camera shake.', '2011-07-01 22:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458362, 959394, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this challenge.  IMO, the lighting needs to bring out more detail all the way through the image to look more like a magazine shot.</td>', 'Great subject for this challenge.  IMO, the lighting needs to bring out more detail all the way through the image to look more like a magazine shot.', '2011-07-01 22:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458434, 959842, 96751, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d identified the falls in the title. Cool bridge.</td>', 'I wish you''d identified the falls in the title. Cool bridge.', '2011-07-02 01:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458435, 959338, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great street shot.</td>', 'Great street shot.', '2011-07-02 01:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458436, 959741, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  I adore wolves.</td>', 'Fabulous.  I adore wolves.', '2011-07-02 01:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458437, 959369, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a splendid droplet/critter/macro shot.</td>', 'What a splendid droplet/critter/macro shot.', '2011-07-02 01:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458438, 959679, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of their heads.  And those giant ears.</td>', 'I love the shape of their heads.  And those giant ears.', '2011-07-02 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458441, 959793, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pov.</td>', 'Very interesting pov.', '2011-07-02 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6458442, 958628, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the velvet stage.</td>', 'Love the velvet stage.', '2011-07-02 01:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
