(6463321, 959705, 18073, '<td valign="top">A very striking image, I love the colour and repeating pattern and I think the composition is nice too.  You have also captured the huge scale of the mine with the inclusion of the vehicles and mining equipment.  Really well done!</td>', 'A very striking image, I love the colour and repeating pattern and I think the composition is nice too.  You have also captured the huge scale of the mine with the inclusion of the vehicles and mining equipment.  Really well done!', '2011-07-06 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
