(6463329, 959334, 18073, '<td valign="top">There were a couple of images vying as my favourite, but this is the one I kept coming back too.<br/> <br/>The amount of detail in the shodows is amazing, the composition I find interesting and the detail astonishing.<br/> <br/>Love this shot, hope you do well!</td>', 'There were a couple of images vying as my favourite, but this is the one I kept coming back too. The amount of detail in the shodows is amazing, the composition I find interesting and the detail astonishing. Love this shot, hope you do well!', '2011-07-06 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
