(6463513, 959644, 108580, '<td valign="top">Immediately I thought with my DPC indoctrinated cap on and said poor composition, cropped legs, can''t see the flower, very high key, bees yellow and black should be shown off... I stopped myself of course and on closer inspection liked the risks you took, the rules you broke. NG have published B&amp;W, especially in the film days. Would they have published this? I really can''t say. My gut tells me it needs film grain. My heart tells me it''s too crisp and clean and non conformist. I can''t make up my mind.</td>', 'Immediately I thought with my DPC indoctrinated cap on and said poor composition, cropped legs, can''t see the flower, very high key, bees yellow and black should be shown off... I stopped myself of course and on closer inspection liked the risks you took, the rules you broke. NG have published B&W, especially in the film days. Would they have published this? I really can''t say. My gut tells me it needs film grain. My heart tells me it''s too crisp and clean and non conformist. I can''t make up my mind.', '2011-07-06 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
