(6465250, 958394, 74911, '<td valign="top">Your efforts have paid you with great results!!! Your versatility blows me away! The best part is, I never get a clue of your entry while it is in voting. You come up with surprises every time and also succeed in your attempts. You are talented and hardworking. 7+ scores and ribbons are becoming your habit nowadays, huh? Great going! God bless your talents!<br/> <br/>Hope National Geographic sees this great image! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-08 10:55:15.</i></td>', 'Your efforts have paid you with great results!!! Your versatility blows me away! The best part is, I never get a clue of your entry while it is in voting. You come up with surprises every time and also succeed in your attempts. You are talented and hardworking. 7+ scores and ribbons are becoming your habit nowadays, huh? Great going! God bless your talents! Hope National Geographic sees this great image! :)', '2011-07-08 10:39:27.000000', '2011-07-08 11:55:15.000000', 0),
