(6465292, 958724, 98339, '<td valign="top">OH, that''s to bad Wendy...(just read your notes).  Osprey do return to the same spot every year to nest right?</td>', 'OH, that''s to bad Wendy...(just read your notes).  Osprey do return to the same spot every year to nest right?', '2011-07-08 11:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6465298, 959742, 63218, '<td valign="top">Hi! I have often done my best to capture this interesting flower in the field, so I especially admire this fine shot.  You probably already know, it''s also called Love-in-a-Mist, &amp; is dedicated to the Christian saint, St. Catherine and is offered to the saint on the 25th of November.  Also Nigella Sativa oil (made from the seeds) was found in Tutankhamen''s tomb. It is known to have been used by Cleopatra for it''s health and beauty giving qualities. Hypocrates, the grandfather of todays scientific medicine, regarded Nigella Sativa as a valuable remedy in hepatic and digestive disorders. I thought you might find these random bits of lore interesting (if you don''t already know). Thanks for entering this fine shot, wish it had scored higher.</td>', 'Hi! I have often done my best to capture this interesting flower in the field, so I especially admire this fine shot.  You probably already know, it''s also called Love-in-a-Mist, & is dedicated to the Christian saint, St. Catherine and is offered to the saint on the 25th of November.  Also Nigella Sativa oil (made from the seeds) was found in Tutankhamen''s tomb. It is known to have been used by Cleopatra for it''s health and beauty giving qualities. Hypocrates, the grandfather of todays scientific medicine, regarded Nigella Sativa as a valuable remedy in hepatic and digestive disorders. I thought you might find these random bits of lore interesting (if you don''t already know). Thanks for entering this fine shot, wish it had scored higher.', '2011-07-08 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 0),
