(6465543, 959053, 108580, '<td valign="top">And I see it was a 4000th! Man that should be fast enough? It''s pretty sharp, yet the crop and jpg compression maybe reduced a bit of the sharpness the original would have had?</td>', 'And I see it was a 4000th! Man that should be fast enough? It''s pretty sharp, yet the crop and jpg compression maybe reduced a bit of the sharpness the original would have had?', '2011-07-08 15:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
