(6466066, 959628, 57229, '<td valign="top">Well earned, Sara. You''ve been poppin up puffins all over and now you got your little blue reward. I think maybe it sort of shows that you went back for another go because there''s (essentially technical) quality in this that you might not have got on a first frenzy. Top hole !</td>', 'Well earned, Sara. You''ve been poppin up puffins all over and now you got your little blue reward. I think maybe it sort of shows that you went back for another go because there''s (essentially technical) quality in this that you might not have got on a first frenzy. Top hole !', '2011-07-09 04:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466082, 959688, 109353, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot Alice, very well done. Congrats on this nice place :D</td>', 'Stunning shot Alice, very well done. Congrats on this nice place :D', '2011-07-09 05:46:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466129, 959411, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the post voting breakdown. I accept that it''s not in your face and that it suffered from that as well as a lot of people thinking it wasn''t typical NG. No harm in that. But as with all the challenges the lack of commenting is what is, well, lacking. There were fabulous shots in this challenge and my vote average was above 6. I''m just sceptical of entering something that''s bound to work for the wow vote only and not the "that''s technically brilliant" vote. Sure, combining both factors is the way forward.</td>', 'Thanks for all the post voting breakdown. I accept that it''s not in your face and that it suffered from that as well as a lot of people thinking it wasn''t typical NG. No harm in that. But as with all the challenges the lack of commenting is what is, well, lacking. There were fabulous shots in this challenge and my vote average was above 6. I''m just sceptical of entering something that''s bound to work for the wow vote only and not the "that''s technically brilliant" vote. Sure, combining both factors is the way forward.', '2011-07-09 06:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466197, 959628, 30861, '<td valign="top">WTG Sara! Just realized you have a new personal best here. And what a great shot! Well done!</td>', 'WTG Sara! Just realized you have a new personal best here. And what a great shot! Well done!', '2011-07-09 10:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466246, 959429, 102315, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon. This is one my favorite places that I have visited in the US. It''s amazing to see the might and power that one of these meteors. I remember the long road in from the interstate and seeing it from above reminds just how far that was.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon. This is one my favorite places that I have visited in the US. It''s amazing to see the might and power that one of these meteors. I remember the long road in from the interstate and seeing it from above reminds just how far that was.', '2011-07-09 12:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466251, 958724, 117717, '<td valign="top">//www.lrconline.com/Extension_Notes_English/pdf/ospry.pdf <br/> <br/>I can understand your sadness about the baby osprey.  I have also been following a pair of nesting ospreys &amp; have noted a web site that may  interest you. Quite a few of these sturdy platforms have been built by the gov. of Ontario ( the pair that I have been watching have built their nest on one).  A few years ago a pair had been nesting on a hydro pole nearby &amp; one had been electrocuted, so a platform was built  &amp; has had Osprey''s every season since!   Looking at your picture of the nest on the sign makes me think that one of these platforms would be a much safer nesting site.  Perhaps the rangers will be interested.<br/> <br/>I really enjoyed looking at your beautiful photos!</td>', '//www.lrconline.com/Extension_Notes_English/pdf/ospry.pdf  I can understand your sadness about the baby osprey.  I have also been following a pair of nesting ospreys & have noted a web site that may  interest you. Quite a few of these sturdy platforms have been built by the gov. of Ontario ( the pair that I have been watching have built their nest on one).  A few years ago a pair had been nesting on a hydro pole nearby & one had been electrocuted, so a platform was built  & has had Osprey''s every season since!   Looking at your picture of the nest on the sign makes me think that one of these platforms would be a much safer nesting site.  Perhaps the rangers will be interested. I really enjoyed looking at your beautiful photos!', '2011-07-09 12:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466252, 958394, 119823, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot! well deserved, congratulations!</td>', 'wonderful shot! well deserved, congratulations!', '2011-07-09 12:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466262, 959684, 47470, '<td valign="top">Your photos always make me so homesick for Switzerland.</td>', 'Your photos always make me so homesick for Switzerland.', '2011-07-09 12:22:25.000000', NULL, 0),
