(6466733, 959603, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Magnum_za:</b></div><hr/><i> Well done on your top10. This image just goes to show what one can do at a zoo with a little bit of ingenuity and a lot of skill. It''s certainly the right way to practice for when you come visit the <a href="//www.sanparks.org.za/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kruger</a>. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I would relish the chance to visit there... I had an uncle in SA once, dunno where he is now though.</td>', 'Originally posted by Magnum_za: Well done on your top10. This image just goes to show what one can do at a zoo with a little bit of ingenuity and a lot of skill. It''s certainly the right way to practice for when you come visit the Kruger.   I would relish the chance to visit there... I had an uncle in SA once, dunno where he is now though.', '2011-07-10 05:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
